968. Then add two zeros at the end because it's 700. So 296800..\n\nNow, sum all these results. 2120 (from ones place) + 4240 (tens place) + 296800 (hundreds place). Let's add them step by step. 2120 + 4240 = 6360</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
