26 + 16720: 2926 + 16000 is 18926, then add 720 to get 19646. Then add 209000 to 19646. 209000 + 19000 is 228000, subtract 354 (since 19646 is 19000 + 646), wait maybe easier to just add directly</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
