o the third part is 69,600..\n\nNow, add all those results together: 1,566 + 13,920 + 69,600. Let me add them step by step. First, 1,566 + 13,920. Let's see, 1,566 + 13,000 is 14,566, then add 920 to get 15,486. Then add 69,600 to that</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
