y 5 and then by 100. So 677 * 5 = 3,385. Then 3,385 * 100 = 338,500..\n\n2. Multiply 677 by 10 (which is the tens place digit 1 multiplied by 10):.\n677 * 10 = 6,770..\n\nNow, add those two results together: 338,500 + 6,770..\n\nLet me calculate that. Adding 338,500 and 6,770:.\n\n338,500.\n+  6,770.\n---------</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
