 all three results together: 133 + 7980 + 119700. Let's add the first two first. 133 + 7980. 133 + 7000 is 7133, then add 980 to get 7133 + 980 = 8113. Wait, that doesn't seem right. Wait, 7980 is 7000 + 980. So 133 + 7000 = 7133, then add 980: 7133 + 980. Let me check that again. 7133 + 900 = 8033, then +80 = 8113. Yes. Now add that to 119700. So 8113 + 119700. Let's compute that. 8113 + 119700. 8113 + 100000 = 108113, then add 19700 more. Wait, 119700 is 100000 + 19700. Wait, no. Wait, 119700 is 110,000 + 9,700. Wait, maybe better to do step by step. 8113 + 119700. Let me add 8000 to 119700 first: 119700 + 8000 = 127700</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
