Now I have all three parts: 2643 (from ones place), 17,620 (tens place), and 528,600 (hundreds place). I need to add these together. Let's start by adding 2643 and 17,620. 2643 + 17,620. Let me add 2000 + 17,000 which is 19,000. Then 643 + 620 is 1,263. Adding those gives 19,000 + 1,263 = 20,263. .\n\nThen add that to 528,600. So 20,263 + 528,600. Adding 20,000 to 528,600 gives 548,600</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
