      "index": 0,
      "text": "15222.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Multiply 27 by 3 (the ones place of 153):**\n   \\[\n   27 \\times 3 = 81\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 27 by 50 (the tens place of 153):**\n   \\[\n   27 \\times 50 = 1350\n   \\]\n\n3. **Sum the results:**\n   \\[\n   81 + 1350 = 1431\n   \\]\n\nSo, the final computed product is **1431**.",
