\nSecond step: 24600.\n\nThird step: 574000.\n\nAdding them up. Let's start by adding 5740 and 24600. 5740 + 24600. 5000 + 24000 = 29000, and 740 + 600 = 1340. So 29000 + 1340 = 30340. Then add that to 574000. So 30340 + 574000</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
