      "text": "194,700.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Multiply 590 by 300:**\n   \\[\n   590 \\times 300 = 177,000\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 590 by 30:**\n   \\[\n   590 \\times 30 = 17,700\n   \\]\n\n3. **Add the two results together:**\n   \\[\n   177,000 + 17,700 = 194,700\n   \\]\n\nSo, the final computed product is \\(\\boxed{194,\\!700}\\).",
