es place).\n63,900 (from tens place).\n71,000 (from hundreds place).\n\nAdding them step by step. First, 2840 + 63,900. Let's compute that. 2840 + 63,900. 2840 + 60,000 is 62,840. Then add 3,900: 62,840 + 3,900 = 66,740..\n\nThen add the last one: 66,740 + 71,000</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
