78,000. Let's add them step by step. First, 2136 + 10,680. Adding those: 2136 + 10,680. Let me line them up:.\n\n  2136.\n+10680.\n------.\n12816.\n\nWait, 2136 + 10,680. 2000 + 10,000 is 12,000. 136 + 680 is 816. So total 12,816. Then add that to 178,000. So 12,816 + 178,000</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
